  "known_limitations": [
    "The read-only governance dispatcher covers observable contract, path, configuration, product-agreement, structured TDD/debug/verify evidence, and scoped human-approval records; command execution and identity proof remain outside the file-only validator.",
    "The backup engine verifies and restores .quinoto-spec safely; cross-repository disaster recovery remains pending.",
    "Workflows and rules remain primarily agent instructions outside the dispatcher.",
    "Huginn & Muninn currently emits a demonstration score and is not a production entropy gate.",
    "Jormungandr, Skald, Norns, and installer runtime paths still require hardening.",
    "Transactional installer rollback and ownership-safe uninstall are implemented; legacy installations without an ownership manifest require manual migration, and Bifrost/Battle Frenzy still require safety validation."
